  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8 : 4 :: 3.2 : x\n\n3 : 6 :: 6 : y\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nFor proportions: (a)/(b) = (c)/(d)\n\nTo find the ratio: (x)/(y)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nFirst proportion: 8 : 4 :: 3.2 : x\n\n⇒ (8)/(4) = (3.2)/(x)\n\n⇒ 2 = (3.2)/(x)\n\n⇒ x = (3.2)/(2)\n\n⇒ x = 1.6\n\nSecond proportion: 3 : 6 :: 6 : y\n\n⇒ (3)/(6) = (6)/(y)\n\n⇒ (1)/(2) = (6)/(y)\n\n⇒ y = 6 × 2\n\n⇒ y = 12\n\nRatio of x to y:\n\n⇒ (x)/(y) = (1.6)/(12)\n\n⇒ (1.6)/(12) = (4)/(30)\n\n⇒ (4)/(30) = (2)/(15)\n\n**The ratio of x to y is 2 : 15.**",
